  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAbility Spreadsheets\n\nSome useful sheets to help you better understand RuneScape's abilities.\n\nAbility Calculations\n⬥ RS Analysis\n⬥ Magic Damage Maths\n⬥ Melee Damage Maths\n⬥ Necromancy Damage Maths\n⬥ Ranged Damage Maths\n⬥ Ability Hit Timings\n⬥ RS Hit Chance Calculator\n⬥ Revenge Damage\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nItems, Rotations and Boss Spreadsheets\n\nUseful to understand items, rotations and boss details.\n\nItem Numbers\n⬥ Comparison of Scriptures\n⬥ Gear Comparisons\nRotation Builders\n⬥ HightDetal's Builder\nBoss Details\n⬥ Telos GP/Hr\n⬥ Telos Defence Regen\n⬥ Zamorak Mechanics\n⬥ Zamorak Calculator\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPvM Accomplishments\n\nThe community-acknowledged means of determining records, and other extraordinary PvM accomplishments.\n\nSpeed Records\n⬥ PvM Records\nOther Accomplishments\n⬥ List of Duo Hard Mode Vorago\n⬥ List of 4k Wardens\n⬥ List of Golden Reapers\n⬥ Arch Glacor Highscores\n⬥ Grandmaster Combat Achievements\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIronman, GP and Misc. Spreadsheets\n\nUseful spreadsheets for Ironmen, money-related maths, Slayer and other assorted topics. Intended for efficient players.\n\nIronmen\n⬥ Bo2's Skilling Guide\n⬥ Manlover´s Iron Guide\nMoney-Related\n⬥ Cost of PvM Calc.\n⬥ Overload Calc.\n⬥ High Alch. Calc\n⬥ Boss GP/hr\n⬥ Elite Dgs. GP/hr\n⬥ Binding Contract GP/hr\nNPCs, Slayer & Familiar\n⬥ Bestiary\n⬥ Slayer Weight & XP\n⬥ Familiar Comparison\nMiscellaneous\n⬥ PvM Abbreviations\n⬥ Legacy Telos' Keybind Visualizer\n⬥ Nami's Insane Reaper Tracker (compact)\n⬥ Nami's Insane Reaper Tracker (expanded)\n⬥ Universal Tracker for most achievements\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n    ",
